          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've learned how best to move in your heavy armor. When wearing heavy armor, if you meet the Strength requirement, instead of reducing the movement penalty by 5 feet, you reduce the penalty by 10 feet (typically reducing the penalty to 0). If you're a dwarf with the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Unburdened Iron] feat, increase your Speed by 5 feet.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
