          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You begin Casting a Spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wearing your signifer's mask.</p><hr /><p>You harness the magical energy flowing through your eyeless mask to effortlessly protect you from visual effects. You [[/act avert-gaze]]. While Averting your Gaze in this way, you also gain a +2 circumstance bonus to saving throws and checks to disbelieve illusions.</p>"
