      "fileName": "sense-iniquity.json",
      "id": "3XFKXB3ffeIkrQYe",
      "name": "Sense Iniquity",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "3XFKXB3ffeIkrQYe",
        "folder": "XRRUoCPkAURK2l50",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Sense Iniquity",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p>Your Hellknight training gives you the ability to focus your senses and root out those who would attempt to deceive or hide from you. For 1 minute, you gain a +2 status bonus to your Perception DC against attempts to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Create a Diversion], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Feint] you, or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Lie] to you. During this time, if you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Seek] to locate a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden] creature or to see through a creature's @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Impersonate] attempt, you gain a +2 status bonus to the Perception check.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "PT1H"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 8
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
